{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38042","headline":"李太舍池上玩红薇醉题 · 韩偓","name":"李太舍池上玩红薇醉题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花低池小水泙泙，花落池心片片轻。\n酩酊不能羞白鬓，顚狂犹自睠红英。\n乍爲旅客颜常厚，每见同人眼暂明。\n京洛园林归未得，天涯相顾一含情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}